The '''Bingo Lava Rod''' is a {{Rare}} [[Fishing Rod]]<!-- with the {{AttributeLink|Trophy Hunter V}} [[Attribute]] applied-->.

== Obtaining ==
The '''Bingo Lava Rod''' may be offered when talking to {{NPCSprite|Bingo}} on a [[Bingo#Bingo Modes|Special Bingo]] profile after completing a set number of goals.

