== Trivia ==
*As it is {{Soulbound}}, the '''Bingo Lava Rod''' cannot be transferred from a {{Gamemode|Bingo}} profile to any other profile.
*Prior to the revamp of [[Attributes]], the '''Bingo Lava Rod''' came with {{Attr|Trophy Hunter V}} pre-applied.

